{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837070/extras/1812a2ed32e181e6584311cf6d0fecfb.avif?t=1762994690\" width=1033 height=333 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kuiper Roulette</strong> is a <i>strategic turn-based card game</i> with fun and cute space themes ranging from cool card designs to silly space animations. Your objective is to be last one standing and not drawing an asteroid card! Use items, boost items, steal items, and trade items with the diverse mechanics given to you! The game is <i>heavily</i> RNG, but every single random output can be biased or manipulated to the players choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the casino, a place of celestial masses with no hope in their system, resorting to gamble their worthless existence for the chance to double their wealth. This game features addiction, gambling, and strategy throughout it's several modes and gives you new strategies by playing with other bots and starter packs. It's the game where achievements don't just look nice but also allow you to progress and use more items and packs against bots or other gamblers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837070/extras/e776744a25ba02aae06510d59fe49e14.poster.avif?t=1762994690\" width=274 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837070/extras/e776744a25ba02aae06510d59fe49e14.webm?t=1762994690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2837070?t=1762994690","background_raw"